  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2017-12-10T20:07:53.368Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Tltr: Adding a way for gamers to find other gamers for particular games and add friends and join games together outside of vr chat.\n\nThere seems to be a disconnect in vr to find friends who have the same games or make friends with people who have the same games and play those games together. Currently the process is confusing and complex and I believe he chat would be able to reduce the complexity as well as create and more connected community and allow for gamers to group.\n\nThe idea would be to allow for players to show what games they currently have, want to play or are intrested or willing to play with others. These players could form groups or friends and then agree to go into that game via a portal. The portal would load up the game and then players could connect that way.\n\nThe idea is basically a waiting area for gamers.\n\nI fully understand this would take a lot of work but I think that there is a lack of the social aspect and there is a complexity to the situation that could be reduced. I also think this would be a great addition to the usefulness of vr chat.",
